{"id": "86267", "name": "בעיית קיצון – סכום מינימלי של שני מספרים עם מכפלה נתונה (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Two positive numbers have product \\({{CT:0}}\\). Using calculus, find the smallest possible value of their sum.</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>The smallest value of their sum is:</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\"> [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-root\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: a square root as <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(...)</code>, e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(5*x)</code>. Other roots as a power, with brackets around the exponent: \\(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}\\) is entered as <code dir=\"ltr\">(x+1)^(1/3)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Express the second number through the first by the product, so the sum is a function of one variable on \\(x&gt;0\\); find its critical point and check that it is a minimum.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — The sum as a function of one variable</b><br><p>The Product \\[ xy = {{CT:0}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[y = \\frac{{CT:0}}{x}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[Sum = x + y = x +\\frac{{CT:0}}{x}= x + {{CT:1}}^{-1}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The critical point</b><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[\\frac{d(Sum)}{dx}= 1-{{CT:1}}^{-2} \\]</p><p>To find the minimum \\(\\frac{d(Sum)}{dx}\\) = 0.</p><p>Therefore</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[1-{{CT:1}}^{-2} = 0\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[x^{2} = {{CT:0}}\\]</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[x = ±\\sqrt{{CT:0}}\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Why it is the minimum</b><br><p>For \\(x&gt;0\\) the second derivative is positive:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{d^2(Sum)}{dx^2}={{CT:2}}&gt;0 \\]</p><p>so the sum is convex on \\(x&gt;0\\), and its only critical point there is its absolute minimum.</p><p>\\(x\\) and \\(y\\) must be positive hence the minimum sum is \\[x + y = \\sqrt{{CT:0}}+\\sqrt{{CT:0}}={{CT:3}}\\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "diff", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Diff", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">The numbers must be positive.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You forgot to do the sum.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["correctanswer", "f", "n1", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2"], "nvariants": 19}